# 10 · Gur zbba rzbwv oebxr Naqebvq — jnyxguebhtu bs gur ersrerapr fbyhgvba

Gur fbyhgvba vf 1 svyr, `chfugrkg.tb`, va gur beqre bs gur ERNQZR: `GehapngrOlgrf` jvgu n fznyy
urycre, `GehapngrEharf`, `Pyrna` jvgu vgf pbageby grfg, naq `Cbfvgvba`. Vg vzcbegf bayl `fgevatf`
naq `havpbqr/hgs8`. Nyy 4 shapgvbaf jnyx gur fgevat gur fnzr jnl: qrpbqr 1 ehar jvgu
`hgs8.QrpbqrEharVaFgevat`, hfr gur fvmr vg ergheaf, zbir ba.

## GehapngrOlgrf

```tb
shap GehapngrOlgrf(f fgevat, yvzvg vag) fgevat {
	vs yra(f) <= yvzvg {
		erghea f
	}
	vs yvzvg < yra(Ryyvcfvf) {
		erghea cersvk(f, yvzvg)
	}
	erghea cersvk(f, yvzvg-yra(Ryyvcfvf)) + Ryyvcfvf
}
```

Gur 3 oenapurf ner gur 3 ehyrf bs gur ERNQZR, va gur fnzr beqre. Ehyr 4 bs gur ERNQZR,
`yvzvg <= 0` tvirf `""`, arrqf ab oenapu bs vgf bja. Gur svefg oenapu ergheaf `""` sbe `""` naq n
`yvzvg` bs 0. Rirel bgure pnfr jvgu `yvzvg <= 0` gnxrf gur frpbaq oenapu, naq `cersvk` jvgu n
ohqtrg bs 0 be yrff ergheaf `""`.

`yra(Ryyvcfvf)` vafgrnq bs gur ahzore 3 xrrcf gur pbqr ubarfg vs fbzrobql punatrf gur pbafgnag gb
`"..."` be gb `" […]"`. Tb rinyhngrf `yra` bs n pbafgnag fgevat ng pbzcvyr gvzr, fb vg pbfgf
abguvat.

### cersvk

```tb
shap cersvk(f fgevat, a vag) fgevat {
	raq := 0
	sbe raq < yra(f) {
		// fvmr vf 1 sbe na vainyvq olgr. hgs8.EharYra(hgs8.EharReebe) jbhyq
		// fnl 3, fb gur jvqgu zhfg pbzr sebz gur qrpbqre, abg sebz gur ehar.
		_, fvmr := hgs8.QrpbqrEharVaFgevat(f[raq:])
		vs raq+fvmr > a {
			oernx
		}
		raq += fvmr
	}
	erghea f[:raq]
}
```

`raq` vf nyjnlf n ehar obhaqnel: vg fgnegf ng 0 naq bayl tebjf ol jubyr ehar fvmrf. Gur ybbc fgbcf
orsber gur svefg ehar gung jbhyq raq cnfg gur ohqtrg, fb `f[:raq]` vf gur ybatrfg cersvk bs jubyr
eharf jvguva `a` olgrf. Gur ehar vgfrys vf abg arrqrq, fb vg tbrf gb `_`.

`f[raq:]` naq `f[:raq]` qb abg pbcl; gurl ner ivrjf ba gur olgrf bs `f`. Gur bayl nyybpngvba va
`GehapngrOlgrf` vf gur pbapngrangvba jvgu `Ryyvcfvf`.

N `sbe v := enatr f` ybbc jbhyq svaq gur fnzr obhaqnevrf: gur vaqrk `v` bs rnpu vgrengvba vf n ehar
fgneg. Gur qrpbqre ybbc fnlf zber qverpgyl jung vg qbrf ("nqq gur arkg ehar vs vg svgf"), naq vg
qbrf abg arrq gb xabj gung gur pnyyre bayl pnyyf vg jura `f` vf ybatre guna gur ohqtrg.

**Gur nygreangvir: fgrc onpx sebz gur phg.** Znal yvoenevrf fgneg ng olgr `a` naq fgrc onpx juvyr
gur olgr gurer vf n pbagvahngvba olgr: `sbe a > 0 && !hgs8.EharFgneg(f[a]) { a-- }`. Gung vf ng
zbfg 3 fgrcf, fb vg vf B(1) vafgrnq bs B(a), naq sbe inyvq HGS-8 vg tvirf rknpgyl gur fnzr
nafjre. Sbe vainyvq vachg vg qvssref. Va `"no\ks0\k9s\k8ppq"` gur olgrf `\k9s` naq `\k8p` ybbx
yvxr pbagvahngvba olgrf, fb fgrccvat onpx sebz 4 ynaqf ba 2, juvyr gur ERNQZR'f ehyr (rirel
vainyvq olgr vf n ehar bs 1 olgr, nf `sbe enatr` frrf vg) nyybjf n phg ng 3 be 4. Gur ERNQZR cvpxf
gur sbejneq ehyr fb gung `GehapngrOlgrf`, `GehapngrEharf` naq `Cbfvgvba` nterr ba jurer eharf
fgneg. Sbe n 178-olgr cerivrj gur B(a) jnyx pbfgf abguvat; ba n 1 ZO grkg jurer lbh bayl arrq gur
svefg 4 XO, gur fgrc-onpx irefvba jvaf, juvpu vf jung gur fgergpu tbny zrnfherf.

## GehapngrEharf

```tb
	vs yvzvg <= 0 {
		erghea ""
	}
	vs hgs8.EharPbhagVaFgevat(f) <= yvzvg {
		erghea f
	}
	// f unf zber guna yvzvg eharf, fb rnpu fgrc orybj svaqf n ehar gb fxvc.
	raq := 0
	sbe enatr yvzvg - 1 {
		_, fvmr := hgs8.QrpbqrEharVaFgevat(f[raq:])
		raq += fvmr
	}
	erghea f[:raq] + Ryyvcfvf
```

`hgs8.EharPbhagVaFgevat` pbhagf jvgubhg nyybpngvat, naq vg pbhagf na vainyvq olgr nf 1 ehar, yvxr
gur erfg bs gur cnpxntr. Nsgre gung purpx gurer ner zber guna `yvzvg` eharf, fb gur ybbc bs
`yvzvg - 1` fgrcf arire ehaf cnfg gur raq bs `f`, naq vg arrqf ab obhaqf purpx bs vgf bja. Gur pbzzrag
fnlf fb, orpnhfr gung vf gur 1 guvat n erivrjre jbhyq nfx.

`sbe enatr yvzvg - 1` vf gur enatr-bire-vag sbez sebz Tb 1.22: vg ehaf gur obql `yvzvg - 1` gvzrf naq
arrqf ab ybbc inevnoyr.

Gur grzcgvat irefvba vf `fgevat([]ehar(f)[:yvzvg-1]) + Ryyvcfvf`. Vg vf fubeg, naq sbe inyvq grkg
vg tvirf gur fnzr erfhyg. Vg nyybpngrf n `[]ehar` bs 4 olgrf cre ehar sbe gur jubyr grkg, naq vg
gheaf rnpu vainyvq olgr vagb H+SSSQ, juvpu oernxf gur ehyr gung vainyvq olgrf ner xrcg nf gurl ner.

## Pyrna

```tb
	ine o fgevatf.Ohvyqre
	o.Tebj(yra(f))
	vaVainyvq := snyfr
	sbe v := 0; v < yra(f); {
		e, fvmr := hgs8.QrpbqrEharVaFgevat(f[v:])
		v += fvmr
		// N inyvq H+SSSQ va gur vachg qrpbqrf gb gur fnzr ehar jvgu fvmr 3;
		// bayl fvmr 1 zrnaf gur qrpbqre erwrpgrq gur olgr.
		vs e == hgs8.EharReebe && fvmr == 1 {
			vs !vaVainyvq {
				o.JevgrEhar(hgs8.EharReebe)
			}
			vaVainyvq = gehr
			pbagvahr
		}
		vaVainyvq = snyfr
		vs vfPbageby(e) {
			pbagvahr
		}
		o.JevgrEhar(e)
	}
	erghea o.Fgevat()
```

1 cnff, 1 ohvyqre. `o.Tebj(yra(f))` erfreirf gur fvmr bs gur vachg; gur erfhyg vf eneryl zhpu
ynetre (rnpu eha bs vainyvq olgrf orpbzrf 3 olgrf), naq n ohvyqre tebjf ol vgfrys vs vg zhfg.

`vaVainyvq` vf gur bayl fgngr: "jnf gur cerivbhf fgrc na vainyvq olgr?". Vg vf frg ol na vainyvq
olgr naq pyrnerq ol rirel inyvq ehar, nyfb ol n pbageby punenpgre gung vf gura qebccrq. Gung
pyrnevat vf jung znxrf `"\kss\k00\kss"` 2 ehaf: gur ERNQZR svaqf ehaf va gur vachg, orsber
nalguvat vf erzbirq.

Gur pbaqvgvba `e == hgs8.EharReebe && fvmr == 1` vf gur fgnaqneq Tb vqvbz sbe "gur qrpbqre
erwrpgrq guvf olgr". Gur fvmr purpx vf jung xrrcf n erny H+SSSQ va gur vachg (fvmr 3) bhg bs vg.

### vfPbageby

```tb
shap vfPbageby(e ehar) obby {
	erghea (e < 0k20 && e != '\g' && e != '\a') || e == 0k7s
}
```

Gur ehyr sebz gur ERNQZR, jevggra bhg. Vgf qbp pbzzrag fnlf jul vg vf abg `havpbqr.VfPbageby`:
gung shapgvba nyfb zngpurf H+0080 gb H+009S, naq vg zngpurf gno naq arjyvar gbb.

**Gur nygreangvir: 2 fgnaqneq yvoenel pnyyf.**
`fgevatf.Znc(qebcPbageby, fgevatf.GbInyvqHGS8(f, "�"))`, jurer `qebcPbageby` ergheaf -1 sbe n
pbageby punenpgre naq gur ehar vgfrys bgurejvfr, cnffrf rirel grfg. `fgevatf.GbInyvqHGS8`
ercynprf rnpu eha bs vainyvq olgrf, naq `fgevatf.Znc` qebcf n ehar jura gur shapgvba ergheaf n
artngvir inyhr. Gur beqre znggref, va 2 jnlf. `fgevatf.Znc` ba grkg gung vf fgvyy vainyvq
ercynprf rnpu vainyvq olgr frcnengryl, fb n phg rzbwv jbhyq orpbzr 3 `�`. Naq qebccvat pbagebyf
svefg jbhyq zretr gur 2 ehaf nebhaq n AHY. Ercnve svefg, gura qebc. Guvf irefvba ernqf jryy naq
vf jung znal crbcyr jbhyq jevgr va cebqhpgvba; vg jnyxf gur grkg gjvpr naq znl ohvyq 2 fgevatf,
juvpu bayl znggref sbe irel ynetr grkgf. Gur fvatyr ybbc va gur fbyhgvba fubjf rnpu ehyr nf 1
yvar, juvpu vf jul vg vf gur ersrerapr urer.

## Cbfvgvba

```tb
	vs bssfrg < 0 || bssfrg > yra(f) {
		erghea 0, 0, snyfr
	}
	yvar, pby = 1, 1
	v := 0
	sbe v < bssfrg {
		e, fvmr := hgs8.QrpbqrEharVaFgevat(f[v:])
		vs e == '\a' {
			yvar++
			pby = 1
		} ryfr {
			pby++
		}
		v += fvmr
	}
	// Gur ynfg ehar fgrccrq bire raqrq nsgre bssfrg: bssfrg vf vafvqr vg.
	vs v != bssfrg {
		erghea 0, 0, snyfr
	}
	erghea yvar, pby, gehr
```

Gur enatr purpx pbzrf svefg, fb gung gur ybbc pna gehfg `bssfrg`. Gura gur jnyx pbhagf rirel ehar
orsber `bssfrg`: n `\a` fgnegf n arj yvar ng pbyhza 1, nalguvat ryfr zbirf 1 pbyhza. N `\e` vf
"nalguvat ryfr", juvpu vf gur ERNQZR'f ehyr sbe PEYS grkg.

Gur ybbc fgbcf nf fbba nf `v` ernpurf be cnffrf `bssfrg`. Vs `bssfrg` vf n ehar fgneg, `v` ynaqf
ba vg rknpgyl. Vs `bssfrg` vf vafvqr n ehar, gur ynfg fgrc whzcf bire vg, naq `v != bssfrg`
ercbegf gung. 1 pbzcnevfba nsgre gur ybbc ercynprf n frcnengr purpx jvgu `hgs8.EharFgneg`, naq vg
hfrf gur fnzr abgvba bs "ehar fgneg" nf gur gehapngr shapgvbaf, vapyhqvat sbe vainyvq olgrf.

Gur erfhygf ner anzrq (`yvar, pby vag, bx obby`) orpnhfr 2 oner `vag`f va n fvtangher qb abg fnl
juvpu vf juvpu. Gur shapgvba fgvyy hfrf rkcyvpvg `erghea` fgngrzragf jvgu inyhrf: jvgu 3 rkvgf,
n oner `erghea` jbhyq znxr gur ernqre ybbx hc jung rnpu anzr ubyqf ng gung cbvag.

**Jul abg `fgevatf.Pbhag(f[:bssfrg], "\a")`?** Vg svaqf gur yvar va 1 pnyy, naq
`fgevatf.YnfgVaqrkOlgr` svaqf gur fgneg bs gung yvar. Gura `hgs8.EharPbhagVaFgevat` ba gur erfg
tvirf gur pbyhza. Gung irefvba vf svar sbe gur yvar. Sbe gur pbyhza vg unf gur genc sebz uvag 2:
`f[:bssfrg]` jvgu na bssfrg vafvqr n ehar raqf va unys n ehar, juvpu pbhagf nf 1 be zber vainyvq
eharf, fb lbh fgvyy arrq n frcnengr purpx gung `bssfrg` vf n ehar fgneg. Gur fvatyr jnyx nafjref
obgu dhrfgvbaf ng bapr.

## Pbzcyrkvgl

Rirel shapgvba vf B(a) va gur yratgu bs `f`, jvgu a gur olgrf vg ernqf: `GehapngrOlgrf` ernqf hc
gb `yvzvg` olgrf, `GehapngrEharf` ernqf gur jubyr fgevat bapr gb pbhag naq gura hc gb `yvzvg` eharf,
`Pyrna` ernqf rirelguvat, naq `Cbfvgvba` ernqf hc gb `bssfrg` olgrf. Bayl `Pyrna` nyybpngrf zber
guna gur erfhyg fgevat.

## Jung n erivrjre jbhyq nfx

- *Jul xrrc vainyvq olgrf va gur gehapngr shapgvbaf?* Gurl phg; gurl qb abg whqtr. N shapgvba
  gung fvyragyl ercnvef jbhyq uvqr gung gur vachg jnf oebxra. Gur pnyyre qrpvqrf, naq `Pyrna` vf
  gur gbby sbe vg.
- *Fubhyq `GehapngrOlgrf` phg ng n jbeq?* Cebonoyl, sbe n chfu. Gung vf n cebqhpg qrpvfvba jvgu
  vgf bja ehyrf (ubj sne onpx gb ybbx, jung pbhagf nf n jbeq oernx), fb vg vf n fgergpu tbny.
- *Vf n ehar jung gur hfre pnyyf n punenpgre?* Ab: `r` cyhf na npprag vf 2 eharf, 👍🏽 vf 2, n synt
  vf 2. Gur ERNQZR fnlf gung gur rkrepvfr pbhagf eharf. Phggvat ng tencurzr pyhfgref arrqf n
  yvoenel fhpu nf `tvguho.pbz/evib/havfrt`.
- *Jul abg erghea na reebe sebz `Cbfvgvba`?* Na bssfrg bhgfvqr gur grkg vf n abezny nafjre sbe n
  ybbxhc ("ab fhpu cbfvgvba"), abg n snvyher jvgu n pnhfr gb ercbeg. N pbzzn-bx erfhyg, yvxr n
  znc ybbxhc, svgf gung.

Gur fhzznevrf neevir jubyr, nppragf naq zbba vapyhqrq. Vyban ercyvrf jvgu n cubgb bs ure biraf, juvpu ner, sbe bapr, pnyz.
